{"game":"Pokemon Pinball Ruby & Sapphire","source":"custom","apworld":"pokemon_pinball_rs.apworld","world_version":"0.3.2","groups":[{"name":"Game Options","collapsed":false,"options":[{"key":"death_link","name":"Death Link","kind":"toggle","doc":"When you die, everyone who enabled death link dies. Of course, the reverse is true too.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>When you die, everyone who enabled death link dies. Of course, the reverse is true too.</p>\n","default":"false","doc_fr":"Quand vous mourez, tous ceux qui ont permis la mort meurent. Bien sûr, l'inverse est vrai aussi.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Quand vous mourez, tous ceux qui ont permis la mort meurent. Bien sûr, l'inverse est vrai aussi.</p>\n"},{"key":"progression_balancing","name":"Progression Balancing","kind":"named_range","doc":"A system that can move progression earlier, to try and prevent the player from getting stuck and bored early.\n\nA lower setting means more getting stuck. A higher setting means less getting stuck.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>A system that can move progression earlier, to try and prevent the player from getting stuck and bored early.</p>\n<p>A lower setting means more getting stuck. A higher setting means less getting stuck.</p>\n","min":0,"max":99,"default":50,"special":{"disabled":0,"normal":50,"extreme":99},"doc_fr":"Un système qui peut déplacer la progression plus tôt, pour essayer et empêcher le joueur de se coincer et s'ennuyer tôt.\n\nUn réglage plus bas signifie qu'il reste coincé. Un réglage plus élevé signifie moins se coincer.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Un système qui peut déplacer la progression plus tôt, pour essayer et empêcher le joueur de se coincer et s'ennuyer tôt.</p>\n<p>Un réglage plus bas signifie qu'il reste coincé. Un réglage plus élevé signifie moins se coincer.</p>\n"},{"key":"accessibility","name":"Accessibility","kind":"choice","doc":"Set rules for reachability of your items/locations.\n\n**Full:** ensure everything can be reached and acquired.\n\n**Minimal:** ensure what is needed to reach your goal can be acquired.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Set rules for reachability of your items/locations.</p>\n<p><strong>Full:</strong> ensure everything can be reached and acquired.</p>\n<p><strong>Minimal:</strong> ensure what is needed to reach your goal can be acquired.</p>\n","choices":[{"value":"full","label":"Full","id":0},{"value":"minimal","label":"Minimal","id":2}],"aliases":{"items":"full","locations":"full","none":"minimal"},"default":"full","doc_fr":"Définir les règles d'accessibilité de vos objets/emplacements.\n\n**Full:** s'assurer que tout peut être atteint et acquis.\n\n**Minimal:** s'assurer que ce qui est nécessaire pour atteindre votre objectif peut être acquis.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Définir les règles d'accessibilité de vos objets/emplacements.</p>\n<p><strong>Full:</strong> s'assurer que tout peut être atteint et acquis.</p>\n<p><strong>Minimal:</strong> s'assurer que ce qui est nécessaire pour atteindre votre objectif peut être acquis.</p>\n"},{"key":"goal","name":"Goal","kind":"set","doc":"What is considered the goal for Pokemon Pinball:\nIncluding multiple options will require all to have been met\nPokédex: a required number of Pokémon are registered within the Pokédex\nScore: a certain target score is reached on either the Ruby or Sapphire board (must be registered to the high scores)\nTargets: certain specific target Pokémon have been captured\nMedals: receiving a certain number of Pokédex Medals from the multiworld","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"default":["Pokedex"],"valid_keys":["Medals","Pokedex","Score","Targets"],"doc_fr":"Ce qui est considéré comme le but pour Pokemon Pinball:\nY compris les options multiples exigeront que tous aient été satisfaits Pokédex: un nombre requis de Pokémon sont inscrits dans le score Pokédex: un certain score cible est atteint sur le conseil Ruby ou Sapphire (doivent être inscrits aux scores élevés)\nTargets: certaines cibles spécifiques Pokémon ont été capturées\nMedals: recevoir un certain nombre de Médailles Pokédex du Multiworld"},{"key":"difficulty","name":"Difficulty","kind":"choice","doc":"Whether logic should apply additional restrictions on locations\nNormal: All locations other than catching have additional requirements\nHard: Simple board tasks such as hatching and evolutions have no additional requirements\nExpert: Longer board tasks such as 25+ multiplier bumper hits and catching Groudon/Kyogre have no additional requirements\nMaster: No locations have additional requirements other than what is strictly required","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"choices":[{"value":"normal","label":"Normal","id":0},{"value":"hard","label":"Hard","id":1},{"value":"expert","label":"Expert","id":2},{"value":"master","label":"Master","id":3}],"aliases":{},"default":"normal","doc_fr":"Indique si la logique doit appliquer des restrictions supplémentaires sur les emplacements Normal : Tous les emplacements autres que la capture ont des exigences supplémentaires Difficile : Les tâches simples de planche telles que l'éclosion et les évolutions n'ont pas d'exigences supplémentaires Expert : Les tâches de planches plus longues telles que 25 + pare-chocs multiplicateurs et la capture de Groudon/Kyogre n'ont pas d'exigences supplémentaires Master : Aucun emplacement n'a d'autres exigences que celles strictement requises"},{"key":"starting_board","name":"Starting Board","kind":"choice","doc":"The first unlocked board","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"choices":[{"value":"ruby","label":"Ruby","id":0},{"value":"sapphire","label":"Sapphire","id":1}],"aliases":{},"default":"random","doc_fr":"La première carte déverrouillée"},{"key":"single_board","name":"Single Board Mode","kind":"toggle","doc":"If enabled, only items/locations associated with your starting board will be created.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"false","doc_fr":"Si activé, seuls les éléments/emplacements associés à votre tableau de départ seront créés."},{"key":"pokedex_requirement","name":"Pokédex Requirement","kind":"range","doc":"On Pokédex goal, the amount of Pokémon registered required to goal.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":1,"max":205,"default":125,"doc_fr":"Sur le but de Pokédex, la quantité de Pokémon enregistrée est nécessaire pour atteindre le but."},{"key":"score_requirement","name":"Score Requirement","kind":"range","doc":"On Score goal, the required score for goal.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":0,"max":100000000000,"default":0,"doc_fr":"Sur le but de score, le score requis pour le but."},{"key":"pokemon_targets","name":"Pokémon Targets","kind":"set","doc":"On Targets goal, what specific Pokémon are required for goal.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"default":["Groudon","Jirachi","Kyogre","Rayquaza"],"valid_keys":["Abra","Absol","Aerodactyl","Aggron","Alakazam","Altaria","Anorith","Armaldo","Aron","Azumarill","Azurill","Bagon","Baltoy","Banette","Barboach","Beautifly","Beldum","Bellossom","Blaziken","Breloom","Cacnea","Cacturne","Camerupt","Carvanha","Cascoon","Castform","Chikorita","Chimecho","Chinchou","Clamperl","Claydol","Combusken","Corphish","Corsola","Cradily","Crawdaunt","Crobat","Cyndaquil","Delcatty","Dodrio","Doduo","Donphan","Dusclops","Duskull","Dustox","Electrike","Electrode","Exploud","Feebas","Flygon","Gardevoir","Geodude","Girafarig","Glalie","Gloom","Golbat","Goldeen","Golduck","Golem","Gorebyss","Graveler","Grimer","Groudon","Grovyle","Grumpig","Gulpin","Gyarados","Hariyama","Heracross","Horsea","Huntail","Igglybuff","Illumise","Jigglypuff","Jirachi","Kadabra","Kecleon","Kingdra","Kirlia","Koffing","Kyogre","Lairon","Lanturn","Latias","Latios","Lileep","Linoone","Lombre","Lotad","Loudred","Ludicolo","Lunatone","Luvdisc","Machamp","Machoke","Machop","Magcargo","Magikarp","Magnemite","Magneton","Makuhita","Manectric","Marill","Marshtomp","Masquerain","Mawile","Medicham","Meditite","Metagross","Metang","Mightyena","Milotic","Minun","Mudkip","Muk","Natu","Nincada","Ninetales","Ninjask","Nosepass","Numel","Nuzleaf","Oddish","Pelipper","Phanpy","Pichu","Pikachu","Pinsir","Plusle","Poochyena","Psyduck","Raichu","Ralts","Rayquaza","Regice","Regirock","Registeel","Relicanth","Rhydon","Rhyhorn","Roselia","Sableye","Salamence","Sandshrew","Sandslash","Sceptile","Seadra","Seaking","Sealeo","Seedot","Seviper","Sharpedo","Shedinja","Shelgon","Shiftry","Shroomish","Shuppet","Silcoon","Skarmory","Skitty","Slaking","Slakoth","Slugma","Snorunt","Solrock","Spheal","Spinda","Spoink","Starmie","Staryu","Surskit","Swablu","Swalot","Swampert","Swellow","Taillow","Tentacool","Tentacruel","Torchic","Torkoal","Totodile","Trapinch","Treecko","Tropius","Vibrava","Vigoroth","Vileplume","Volbeat","Voltorb","Vulpix","Wailmer","Wailord","Walrein","Weezing","Whiscash","Whismur","Wigglytuff","Wingull","Wobbuffet","Wurmple","Wynaut","Xatu","Zangoose","Zigzagoon","Zubat"],"doc_fr":"Sur les objectifs, quel Pokémon spécifique est nécessaire pour atteindre le but."},{"key":"total_medals","name":"Max Medal Count","kind":"range","doc":"On Medals goal, maximum number of medals to include in the pool of items.\nThe exact number may be less depending on settings.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":1,"max":255,"default":75,"doc_fr":"Sur le but des médailles, le nombre maximum de médailles à inclure dans la réserve d'articles.\nLe nombre exact peut être inférieur selon les paramètres."},{"key":"medal_requirement","name":"Required Medal Count","kind":"range","doc":"Percentage of Pokédex Medals required to goal.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":1,"max":100,"default":66,"doc_fr":"Pourcentage des médailles Pokédex nécessaires pour atteindre le but."},{"key":"goal_trigger","name":"Goal Trigger","kind":"choice","doc":"Defines what triggers goal once all targets have been reached.\nBall: goal is triggered at the end of the current ball.\nGroudon/Kyogre: goal is triggered when Groudon or Kyogre are defeated while all goal targets have been met.\nRayquaza: goal is triggered when Rayquaza is defeated while all goal targets have been met.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"choices":[{"value":"ball","label":"Ball","id":0},{"value":"groudon_kyogre","label":"Groudon/Kyogre","id":1},{"value":"rayquaza","label":"Rayquaza","id":2}],"aliases":{},"default":"ball","doc_fr":"Définit ce qui déclenche l'objectif une fois toutes les cibles atteintes.\nBall: but est déclenché à la fin de la balle actuelle.\nGroudon/Kyogre: le but est déclenché lorsque Groudon ou Kyogre sont vaincus tandis que tous les objectifs ont été atteints.\nRayquaza: Le but est déclenché lorsque Rayquaza est vaincu alors que tous les objectifs ont été atteints."},{"key":"bonus_multiplier_checks","name":"Bonus Multiplier Checks","kind":"range","doc":"Number of bonus multiplier hits to include as checks per-board","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":0,"max":99,"default":0,"doc_fr":"Nombre de bonus multiplicateurs à inclure comme contrôles par-board"},{"key":"ball_upgrade_checks","name":"Ball Upgrade Checks","kind":"range","doc":"Number of ball upgrades to include as checks. This includes both the ball upgrades ","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":0,"max":99,"default":0,"doc_fr":"Nombre de mises à niveau de boules à inclure comme vérifications. Cela inclut les deux améliorations de la balle"},{"key":"shop_tracks","name":"Shop Tracks","kind":"range","doc":"Number of available shop tracks available per board.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":0,"max":5,"default":3,"doc_fr":"Nombre de pistes disponibles par carte."},{"key":"shop_track_length","name":"Shop Track Length","kind":"range","doc":"Number of available locations per shop track.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":1,"max":15,"default":10,"doc_fr":"Nombre d'emplacements disponibles par voie de magasin."},{"key":"shop_prices","name":"Shop Prices","kind":"choice","doc":"Low: Shop prices linearly increase by 5.\nMedium: Shop prices follow an exponential curve of 1.65.\nHigh: Shop prices linearly increase by 10.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"choices":[{"value":"low","label":"Low","id":1},{"value":"medium","label":"Medium","id":2},{"value":"high","label":"High","id":3}],"aliases":{},"default":"low","doc_fr":"Low: Les prix des magasins augmentent linéairement de 5.\nMedium: Les prix à la boutique suivent une courbe exponentielle de 1,65.\nHigh: Les prix des magasins augmentent linéairement de 10."},{"key":"roulette_prizes","name":"Roulette Locations","kind":"range","doc":"Number of checks locked behind roulette prizes per board.\nNote that Zigzagoon is not considered in logic for these locations.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":0,"max":40,"default":5,"doc_fr":"Nombre de chèques verrouillés derrière les prix de roulette par planche.\nNotez que Zigzagoon n'est pas considéré en logique pour ces emplacements."},{"key":"evo_mode","name":"Evo Mode","kind":"choice","doc":"Evo Mode Behavior\nArrows: Each arrow of Evo mode is split up and added to the pool.\nFull: All arrows are condensed into a single item and added to the pool.\nStart With: Evo Mode is placed within your starting inventory.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"choices":[{"value":"arrows","label":"Arrows","id":0},{"value":"full","label":"Full","id":1},{"value":"start_with","label":"Start With","id":2}],"aliases":{},"default":"arrows","doc_fr":"Comportement en mode Evo\nArrows: Chaque flèche du mode Evo est divisée et ajoutée à la piscine.\nFull: Toutes les flèches sont condensées en un seul élément et ajoutées au pool.\nStart With: Evo Mode est placé dans votre inventaire de départ."},{"key":"collect_pokedex","name":"Collect Pokédex","kind":"toggle","doc":"Whether server collects should apply to Pokédex locations. This can cause goaling if all goals are tied to\nPokédex locations.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"false","doc_fr":"Indique si le serveur collecte doit s'appliquer aux emplacements de Pokédex. Cela peut causer des buts si tous les buts sont liés aux emplacements de Pokédex."},{"key":"ringlink","name":"RingLink","kind":"toggle","doc":"Links coin gain/loss with other players.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"false","doc_fr":"Lier gain/perte de pièce avec d'autres joueurs."},{"key":"music_shuffle","name":"Music Shuffle","kind":"choice","doc":"Shuffles music, including unused tracks.\nOff: Disables music shuffle\nShuffle: Each track replaces exactly one other track\nChaos: Each track rolls a random song to replace it, allowing duplicates","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"choices":[{"value":"off","label":"Off","id":0},{"value":"shuffle","label":"Shuffle","id":1},{"value":"chaos","label":"Chaos","id":2}],"aliases":{"false":"off"},"default":"off","doc_fr":"Shuffles musique, y compris les morceaux inutilisés.\nOff: Désactive la musique shuffle\nShuffle: Chaque piste remplace exactement une autre piste\nChaos: Chaque piste roule une chanson aléatoire pour la remplacer, permettant des duplications"}]},{"name":"Item & Location Options","collapsed":true,"options":[{"key":"local_items","name":"Local Items","kind":"set","doc":"Forces these items to be in their native world.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Forces these items to be in their native world.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"items","name_groups":true,"doc_fr":"Force ces objets à être dans leur monde d'origine.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Force ces objets à être dans leur monde d'origine.</p>\n"},{"key":"non_local_items","name":"Non-local Items","kind":"set","doc":"Forces these items to be outside their native world.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Forces these items to be outside their native world.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"items","name_groups":true,"doc_fr":"Force ces objets à être en dehors de leur monde d'origine.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Force ces objets à être en dehors de leur monde d'origine.</p>\n"},{"key":"start_inventory","name":"Start Inventory","kind":"counter","doc":"Start with the specified amount of these items. Example: {Bomb: 1, Arrow: 3} ","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Start with the specified amount of these items. Example: {Bomb: 1, Arrow: 3}</p>\n","default":{},"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"items","min":null,"max":10000,"doc_fr":"Commencez par le montant spécifié de ces éléments. Exemple : {Bomb : 1, Flèche : 3}","doc_html_fr":"<p>Commencez par le montant spécifié de ces éléments. Exemple : {Bomb : 1, Flèche : 3}</p>\n"},{"key":"start_inventory_from_pool","name":"Start Inventory from Pool","kind":"counter","doc":"Start with the specified amount of these items and don't place them in the world. Example: {Bomb: 1, Arrow: 3}\n\nThe game decides what the replacement items will be.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Start with the specified amount of these items and don't place them in the world. Example: {Bomb: 1, Arrow: 3}</p>\n<p>The game decides what the replacement items will be.</p>\n","default":{},"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"items","min":null,"max":10000,"doc_fr":"Commencez par la quantité spécifiée de ces articles et ne les placez pas dans le monde. Exemple : {Bomb : 1, Flèche : 3}\n\nLe jeu décide ce que les articles de remplacement seront.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Commencez par la quantité spécifiée de ces articles et ne les placez pas dans le monde. Exemple : {Bomb : 1, Flèche : 3}</p>\n<p>Le jeu décide ce que les articles de remplacement seront.</p>\n"},{"key":"start_hints","name":"Start Hints","kind":"set","doc":"Start with these item's locations prefilled into the ``!hint`` command.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Start with these item's locations prefilled into the <tt class=\"docutils literal\">!hint</tt> command.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"items","name_groups":true,"doc_fr":"Commencez par les emplacements de ces éléments préremplis dans la commande ``!hint``.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Commencez par les emplacements de ces éléments préremplis dans la commande <tt class=\"docutils literal\">!hint</tt>.</p>\n"},{"key":"start_location_hints","name":"Start Location Hints","kind":"set","doc":"Start with these locations and their item prefilled into the ``!hint`` command.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Start with these locations and their item prefilled into the <tt class=\"docutils literal\">!hint</tt> command.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"locations","name_groups":true,"doc_fr":"Commencez avec ces emplacements et leur élément prérempli dans la commande ``!hint``.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Commencez avec ces emplacements et leur élément prérempli dans la commande <tt class=\"docutils literal\">!hint</tt>.</p>\n"},{"key":"exclude_locations","name":"Excluded Locations","kind":"set","doc":"Prevent these locations from having an important item.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Prevent these locations from having an important item.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"locations","name_groups":true,"doc_fr":"Empêcher ces endroits d'avoir un élément important.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Empêcher ces endroits d'avoir un élément important.</p>\n"},{"key":"priority_locations","name":"Priority Locations","kind":"set","doc":"Prevent these locations from having an unimportant item.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Prevent these locations from having an unimportant item.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"locations","name_groups":true,"doc_fr":"Empêcher ces endroits d'avoir un élément sans importance.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Empêcher ces endroits d'avoir un élément sans importance.</p>\n"},{"key":"item_links","name":"Item Links","kind":"plando","doc":"Share part of your item pool with other players.","weighted":false,"visibility":13,"doc_html":"<p>Share part of your item pool with other players.</p>\n","default":[],"doc_fr":"Partagez une partie de votre pool d'articles avec d'autres joueurs.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Partagez une partie de votre pool d'articles avec d'autres joueu